          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’ve ever found yourself reaching for one pair of glasses to read and another to see clearly at a distance, you know how frustrating it can be. Varilux® lenses are designed to simplify that. With one pair of glasses, you can see clearly up close, far away, and everything in between.</p>",
