          "text": "What Makes Varilux® Lenses Different",
          "html": "What Makes Varilux® Lenses Different",
          "align": "center",
          "id": "5Jy2ymdcLj",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Varilux® lenses are a type of progressive lens, which means they allow you to see at multiple distances without the visible line you might remember from traditional bifocals. Instead of jumping from one prescription to another, the lens transitions smoothly as your eyes move, providing a more natural feel.</p>",
          "align": "center",
