        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>Progressive lenses only work as well as they’re fitted, and that’s where Academy Vision comes in. We take detailed measurements and consider how you use your eyes throughout the day to make sure your lenses are set up correctly.</p><p>Whether you spend a lot of time on a computer, driving, or reading, we tailor your lenses to match your routine.</p>",
