        {
          "t": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Who Benefits Most from Progressive Lenses",
          "html": "Who Benefits Most from Progressive Lenses",
          "id": "ehrzGqbHWL",
          "col": 0,
          "origin": "static"
        },
        {
          "t": "html",
          "html": "<p>If you’ve started noticing that it’s harder to see clearly at different distances, like reading up close and then looking up across the room, you might be a good candidate.</p><p>Most people begin to experience these changes over time. Varilux® lenses are a great option if you’re tired of switching between glasses or want a more seamless way to see throughout your day.</p>",
